750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) ice machine - baffle (small amount of mold - lower left side);
B) fruit cooler - shelving (mold);
C) inside left oven and lower drawers (crumbs/splash);   and
D) tracks of cases and meat freezer by cash register (crumbs/general buildup).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.
